#. translators: %s: number of seconds, e.g. 4.2.
msgid "%s seconds (from banner shown to the visitor’s choice)."
msgstr "%s detik (dari banner ditampilkan hingga pengunjung memilih)."

msgid ""
"A small icon-only button that lets visitors reopen the cookie settings after"
" they have made a choice. It is automatically hidden while the banner or "
"preferences dialog is open."
msgstr ""
"Tombol kecil berupa ikon saja yang memungkinkan pengunjung membuka kembali "
"pengaturan cookie setelah mereka membuat pilihan. Tombol ini otomatis "
"disembunyikan saat banner atau dialog preferensi terbuka."

msgid "About"
msgstr "Tentang"

msgid "About Lynbro Cookie Consent"
msgstr "Tentang Lynbro Cookie Consent"

msgid "Accept all"
msgstr "Terima semua"

msgid "Accept button"
msgstr "Tombol terima"

msgid "Accept rate"
msgstr "Tingkat penerimaan"

msgid "Accessible label"
msgstr "Label aksesibilitas"

msgid "Add a custom language"
msgstr "Tambahkan bahasa khusus"

msgid ""
"Add a small language dropdown to the banner so visitors can switch language "
"manually (their choice is remembered)."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan menu tarik-turun bahasa kecil ke banner agar pengunjung dapat "
"mengganti bahasa secara manual (pilihan mereka diingat)."

msgid "Add your privacy policy link"
msgstr "Tambahkan tautan kebijakan privasi Anda"

msgid "Additional CSS"
msgstr "CSS tambahan"

msgid ""
"Allow the website to remember choices you make (such as language or region) "
"to provide enhanced, personalized features."
msgstr ""
"Izinkan situs web mengingat pilihan yang Anda buat (seperti bahasa atau "
"wilayah) untuk menyediakan fitur yang ditingkatkan dan dipersonalisasi."

msgid "Already downloaded on demand:"
msgstr "Sudah diunduh sesuai permintaan:"

msgid "Always allow %s"
msgstr "Selalu izinkan %s"

msgid "Always on"
msgstr "Selalu aktif"

msgid "Android"
msgstr "Android"

msgid "Anonymous statistics"
msgstr "Statistik anonim"

msgid "Auto (follow visitor’s system)"
msgstr "Otomatis (mengikuti sistem pengunjung)"

msgid "Auto by region"
msgstr "Otomatis berdasarkan wilayah"

msgid "Auto by region (EU opt-in, US opt-out, rest by choice)"
msgstr ""
"Otomatis berdasarkan wilayah (opt-in UE, opt-out AS, lainnya berdasarkan "
"pilihan)"

msgid ""
"Auto uses the light colors by default and the dark colors when the visitor’s"
" device prefers a dark color scheme."
msgstr ""
"Otomatis menggunakan warna terang secara default dan warna gelap saat "
"perangkat pengunjung memilih skema warna gelap."

msgid "Auto-block trackers"
msgstr "Blokir pelacak secara otomatis"

msgid "Auto-detect visitor language"
msgstr "Deteksi bahasa pengunjung secara otomatis"

msgid "Automatic tracker blocking"
msgstr "Pemblokiran otomatis pelacak"

msgid ""
"Automatically block known third-party trackers (Google Analytics, GTM, Meta "
"Pixel, Hotjar, Clarity, and more) until the matching category is granted."
msgstr ""
"Blokir pelacak pihak ketiga yang dikenal (Google Analytics, GTM, Meta Pixel,"
" Hotjar, Clarity, dan lainnya) secara otomatis hingga kategori yang sesuai "
"diizinkan."

msgid ""
"Automatically show the banner in the visitor’s browser language when it is "
"one of the offered languages."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan banner secara otomatis dalam bahasa browser pengunjung jika bahasa"
" tersebut termasuk salah satu bahasa yang ditawarkan."

msgid "Average time to decision"
msgstr "Rata-rata waktu hingga keputusan"

msgid "Background color"
msgstr "Warna latar belakang"

msgid "Banner background"
msgstr "Latar belakang banner"

msgid "Banner description"
msgstr "Deskripsi banner"

msgid "Banner max width (px)"
msgstr "Lebar maksimum banner (px)"

msgid "Banner shown"
msgstr "Banner ditampilkan"

msgid "Banner text on background"
msgstr "Teks banner di atas latar belakang"

msgid "Banner title"
msgstr "Judul banner"

msgid ""
"Base z-index for the banner, overlay, modal and floating button. Increase it"
" if another element covers the banner; lower it if the banner covers "
"something it should not."
msgstr ""
"Z-index dasar untuk banner, overlay, modal, dan tombol mengambang. Naikkan "
"jika elemen lain menutupi banner; turunkan jika banner menutupi elemen yang "
"seharusnya tidak tertutupi."

msgid ""
"Basic HTML allowed: links, bold, italic, line breaks. Leave empty for the "
"translated default."
msgstr ""
"HTML dasar diperbolehkan: tautan, tebal, miring, jeda baris. Biarkan kosong "
"untuk menggunakan teks bawaan yang telah diterjemahkan."

msgid "Benchmark sharing"
msgstr "Berbagi tolok ukur"

msgid ""
"Benchmark sharing is on. Your first comparison will appear here after the "
"weekly report has run."
msgstr ""
"Berbagi tolok ukur aktif. Perbandingan pertama Anda akan muncul di sini "
"setelah laporan mingguan dijalankan."

msgid ""
"Block embedded content (YouTube, Vimeo, Google Maps, social embeds, "
"reCAPTCHA, and more) until consent, showing a tidy placeholder with an "
"\"allow\" button."
msgstr ""
"Blokir konten sematan (YouTube, Vimeo, Google Maps, sematan sosial, "
"reCAPTCHA, dan lainnya) hingga persetujuan diberikan, dengan menampilkan "
"placeholder rapi yang berisi tombol \"izinkan\"."

msgid "Blocking & Embeds"
msgstr "Pemblokiran & sematan"

msgid "Bottom bar"
msgstr "Bilah bawah"

msgid "Bottom left"
msgstr "Kiri bawah"

msgid "Bottom right"
msgstr "Kanan bawah"

msgid "Box corner"
msgstr "Sudut kotak"

msgid "Browser languages"
msgstr "Bahasa peramban"

msgid "Button icon"
msgstr "Ikon tombol"

msgid "Button text"
msgstr "Teks tombol"

msgid "Button text on Accept button"
msgstr "Teks pada tombol Setujui"

msgid "Button text on Reject button"
msgstr "Teks pada tombol Tolak"

msgid "CCPA / CPRA opt-out link"
msgstr "Tautan opt-out CCPA / CPRA"

msgid "Categories"
msgstr "Kategori"

msgid "Category"
msgstr "Kategori"

msgid "Category “%s” — description"
msgstr "Kategori “%s” — deskripsi"

msgid "Category “%s” — name"
msgstr "Kategori “%s” — nama"

msgid "Center modal (with overlay)"
msgstr "Jendela modal di tengah (dengan overlay)"

msgid "Choose language"
msgstr "Pilih bahasa"

msgid ""
"Collect anonymous statistics (how many visitors accept, reject or open "
"preferences). Fully aggregated and cookieless — no IP address or personal "
"data is stored. Shown in the Statistics tab."
msgstr ""
"Kumpulkan statistik anonim (berapa banyak pengunjung yang menerima, menolak,"
" atau membuka preferensi). Dikumpulkan sepenuhnya secara agregat dan tanpa "
"cookie — tidak ada alamat IP atau data pribadi yang disimpan. Ditampilkan di"
" tab Statistik."

msgid ""
"Comma-separated page/post IDs where the banner should not be shown (e.g. "
"landing pages)."
msgstr ""
"ID halaman/pos yang dipisahkan koma, tempat banner tidak boleh ditampilkan "
"(mis. halaman arahan)."

msgid ""
"Configure your GDPR/ePrivacy and Google Consent Mode v2 cookie banner. This "
"plugin helps with compliance but does not constitute legal advice."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasikan banner cookie GDPR/ePrivacy dan Google Consent Mode v2 Anda. "
"Plugin ini membantu kepatuhan tetapi bukan merupakan nasihat hukum."

msgid "Consent Log"
msgstr "Log Persetujuan"

msgid "Consent Mode"
msgstr "Mode Persetujuan"

msgid "Consent Mode v2"
msgstr "Mode Persetujuan v2"

msgid "Consent logging is disabled."
msgstr "Pencatatan persetujuan dinonaktifkan."

msgid "Consent mode"
msgstr "mode persetujuan"

msgid "Content from %s is blocked"
msgstr "Konten dari %s diblokir"

