msgstr "Desain"

msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "Desktop"

msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Perangkat"

msgid "Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information"
msgstr "Jangan Jual atau Bagikan Informasi Pribadi Saya"

msgid "Download all settings as a JSON file to reuse on another site."
msgstr ""
"Unduh semua pengaturan sebagai file JSON untuk digunakan kembali di situs "
"lain."

msgid "Edge offset (px)"
msgstr "Jarak dari tepi (px)"

msgid "Edit texts per language"
msgstr "Sunting teks per bahasa"

msgid "Embed consent category"
msgstr "Kategori persetujuan untuk sematan"

msgid "Embed placeholders"
msgstr "Placeholder untuk sematan"

msgid ""
"Embeds are unblocked when the visitor grants this category (or clicks "
"\"allow\" on the placeholder)."
msgstr ""
"Sematan tidak lagi diblokir saat pengunjung menyetujui kategori ini (atau "
"mengeklik \"izinkan\" pada placeholder)."

msgid "Enable Google Consent Mode v2 signals"
msgstr "Aktifkan sinyal Google Consent Mode v2"

msgid "Enable this category"
msgstr "Aktifkan kategori ini"

msgid "Engagement (last 30 days)"
msgstr "Interaksi (30 hari terakhir)"

msgid ""
"Enjoying Lynbro Cookie Consent? A short, honest review helps other site "
"owners find it. No pressure — only if you have a minute."
msgstr ""
"Suka menggunakan Lynbro Cookie Consent? Ulasan singkat dan jujur membantu "
"pemilik situs lain menemukannya. Tanpa paksaan — hanya jika Anda punya waktu"
" sebentar."

msgid ""
"Enter a WordPress locale code (for example pt_PT or ca) to offer a language "
"that is not bundled. After saving, fill in its texts below."
msgstr ""
"Masukkan kode lokal WordPress (misalnya pt_PT atau ca) untuk menawarkan "
"bahasa yang tidak disertakan. Setelah disimpan, isi teksnya di bawah ini."

msgid "Exclude pages/posts"
msgstr "Kecualikan laman/pos"

msgid "Export CSV"
msgstr "Ekspor CSV"

msgid "Export settings"
msgstr "Ekspor pengaturan"

msgid "Export settings (JSON)"
msgstr "Ekspor pengaturan (JSON)"

msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "Umpan balik"

msgid "Feedback on this plugin"
msgstr "Umpan balik untuk plugin ini"

msgid "Floating box (corner)"
msgstr "Kotak mengambang (sudut)"

msgid "Floating settings button"
msgstr "Tombol pengaturan mengambang"

msgid "Gap from the screen edges for the floating box layout."
msgstr "Jarak dari tepi layar untuk tata letak kotak mengambang."

msgid "General"
msgstr "Umum"

msgid "Get support"
msgstr "Dapatkan dukungan"

msgid "Global Privacy Control (GPC)"
msgstr "Global Privacy Control (GPC)"

msgid "Good contrast (%s:1) — meets WCAG AA."
msgstr "Kontras baik (%s:1) — memenuhi WCAG AA."

msgid "Google Consent Mode v2"
msgstr "Google Consent Mode v2"

msgid ""
"Have an idea, a problem or a request? Send it straight to the developers. "
"This is entirely optional and only sent when you click Send."
msgstr ""
"Punya ide, masalah, atau permintaan? Kirim langsung ke pengembang. Ini "
"sepenuhnya opsional dan hanya dikirim saat Anda mengeklik Kirim."

msgid ""
"Help us understand how visitors interact with the website by collecting and "
"reporting information anonymously."
msgstr ""
"Bantu kami memahami cara pengunjung berinteraksi dengan situs web dengan "
"mengumpulkan dan melaporkan informasi secara anonim."

msgid ""
"Honor the browser Global Privacy Control signal. In opt-out (US/CCPA) mode, "
"visitors with GPC are automatically opted out and shown a visible "
"confirmation (required by California from 2026)."
msgstr ""
"Patuhi sinyal Global Privacy Control dari browser. Dalam mode opt-out "
"(AS/CCPA), pengunjung dengan GPC otomatis dianggap memilih keluar dan akan "
"melihat konfirmasi yang jelas (diwajibkan di California mulai 2026)."

msgid "Horizontal"
msgstr "Horizontal"

msgid "How you compare"
msgstr "Perbandingan Anda"

msgid "Icon"
msgstr "Ikon"

msgid "Icon color"
msgstr "Warna ikon"

msgid "Idea for a new feature or plugin"
msgstr "Ide untuk fitur atau plugin baru"

msgid "Import settings"
msgstr "Impor pengaturan"

msgid "Importing overwrites your current settings."
msgstr "Mengimpor akan menimpa pengaturan Anda saat ini."

msgid ""
"Increase this number whenever your cookie policy changes. Visitors will be "
"asked to consent again."
msgstr ""
"Naikkan angka ini setiap kali kebijakan cookie Anda berubah. Pengunjung akan"
" diminta memberikan persetujuan lagi."

msgid "Installed version"
msgstr "Versi terpasang"

msgid "Invalid security token."
msgstr "Token keamanan tidak valid."

msgid ""
"It works out of the box with GDPR-ready defaults — an equal Reject button "
"and non-essential cookies blocked until consent."
msgstr ""
"Berfungsi langsung dengan pengaturan bawaan siap GDPR — tombol Tolak yang "
"setara dan cookie non-esensial diblokir hingga ada persetujuan."

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Bahasa"

msgid "Language downloaded and activated."
msgstr "Bahasa berhasil diunduh dan diaktifkan."

msgid "Language settings saved."
msgstr "Pengaturan bahasa disimpan."

msgid "Language switches"
msgstr "Pengalih bahasa"

msgid "Languages"
msgstr "Bahasa"

msgid "Last 30 days"
msgstr "30 hari terakhir"

msgid "Last 365 days"
msgstr "365 hari terakhir"

msgid "Last 7 days"
msgstr "7 hari terakhir"

msgid "Leave a review"
msgstr "Tinggalkan ulasan"

msgid "Leave empty to use the Accept button color."
msgstr "Biarkan kosong untuk menggunakan warna tombol Terima."

msgid "Leave empty to use the Button text color."
msgstr "Biarkan kosong untuk menggunakan warna teks tombol."

msgid "Leave empty to use the translated default."
msgstr ""
"Biarkan kosong untuk menggunakan nilai bawaan yang telah diterjemahkan."

msgid "Legal mode"
msgstr "Mode hukum"

msgid "Light"
msgstr "Terang"

msgid "Light colors"
msgstr "Warna terang"

msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

msgid "Live preview (updates as you change Design and General settings):"
msgstr ""
"Pratinjau langsung (diperbarui saat Anda mengubah pengaturan Desain dan "
"Umum):"

msgid "Load content from %s"
msgstr "Muat konten dari %s"

msgid "Local consent log"
msgstr "Log persetujuan lokal"

msgid "Low contrast (%s:1). Aim for at least 4.5:1 to meet WCAG AA."
msgstr "Kontras rendah (%s:1). Upayakan minimal 4,5:1 agar memenuhi WCAG AA."

msgid ""
"Lynbro Cookie Consent is a free, privacy-first cookie banner built by "
"Lynbro. Our goal is a beautiful, genuinely multilingual, GDPR/ePrivacy-ready"
" banner with an equal Reject button — and no pageview limits, no paywall on "
"the essentials, and no front-end tracking."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro Cookie Consent adalah banner cookie gratis yang mengutamakan privasi,"
" dibuat oleh Lynbro. Tujuan kami adalah banner yang indah, benar-benar "
"multibahasa, siap GDPR/ePrivacy, dengan tombol Tolak yang setara — dan tanpa"
" batas tampilan halaman, tanpa paywall untuk hal-hal esensial, serta tanpa "
"pelacakan di front-end."

msgid "Manage opened"
msgstr "Kelola dibuka"

msgid "Manage preferences"
msgstr "Kelola preferensi"

msgid "Manage-preferences button"
msgstr "Tombol Kelola preferensi"

msgid "Marketing"
msgstr "Pemasaran"

msgid ""
"Maximum width of the floating box and center modal. Set 0 to use the "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Lebar maksimum kotak mengambang dan modal tengah. Atur ke 0 untuk "
"menggunakan nilai bawaan."

msgid "Message"
msgstr "Pesan"

msgid "Method"
msgstr "Metode"

msgid "Mobile"
msgstr "Seluler"

msgid "Necessary"
msgstr "Diperlukan"

msgid ""
"Necessary cookies are always active and cannot be disabled. Choose which "
"optional categories visitors can control."
msgstr ""
"Cookie yang diperlukan selalu aktif dan tidak dapat dinonaktifkan. Pilih "
"kategori opsional mana yang dapat dikendalikan pengunjung."

msgid ""
"Need a language that is not bundled? Request it and we will generate it for "
"your site. The translation file is stored in your uploads folder (never "
"overwritten on update) and activated automatically."
msgstr ""
"Butuh bahasa yang belum disertakan? Minta dan kami akan membuatkannya untuk "
"situs Anda. File terjemahan disimpan di folder unggahan Anda (tidak pernah "
"ditimpa saat pembaruan) dan diaktifkan secara otomatis."

msgid "No consent records yet."
msgstr "Belum ada catatan persetujuan."

msgid "No data yet."
msgstr "Belum ada data."

msgid "No file was uploaded."
msgstr "Tidak ada file yang diunggah."

msgid "No thanks, don’t show this again"
msgstr "Tidak, terima kasih, jangan tampilkan ini lagi"

msgid "Notice only"
msgstr "Hanya pemberitahuan"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "Nonaktif"

msgid "Offered languages"
msgstr "Bahasa yang tersedia"

msgid "Offset from corner (px)"
msgstr "Jarak dari sudut (px)"

msgid "On"
msgstr "Aktif"

msgid "Once Weekly"
msgstr "Sekali seminggu"

msgid "Only if you would like a reply. Leave empty to send anonymously."
msgstr ""
"Hanya jika Anda ingin mendapatkan balasan. Biarkan kosong untuk mengirim "
"secara anonim."

msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "Opasitas"

msgid "Operating systems"
msgstr "Sistem operasi"

msgid "Opt-in everywhere"
msgstr "Opt-in di semua wilayah"

msgid "Opt-in everywhere (GDPR — safest)"
msgstr "Opt-in di semua wilayah (GDPR — paling aman)"

msgid "Opt-out everywhere"
msgstr "Opt-out di semua wilayah"

msgid "Opt-out everywhere (CCPA style)"
msgstr "Opt-out di semua wilayah (gaya CCPA)"

msgid ""
"Optional CSS appended to the banner stylesheet. Target the .lynbro-cc "
"selectors."
msgstr ""
"CSS opsional yang ditambahkan ke lembar gaya banner. Targetkan selektor "
".lynbro-cc."

msgid "Other"
msgstr "Lainnya"

msgid ""
"Override any banner text for a specific language. Leave a field empty to use"
" the bundled translation (or the English default). Priority: your override →"
" bundled translation → default."
msgstr ""
"Timpa teks banner apa pun untuk bahasa tertentu. Biarkan bidang kosong untuk"
" menggunakan terjemahan bawaan (atau default bahasa Inggris). Prioritas: "
"penggantian Anda → terjemahan bawaan → default."

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Ikhtisar"

msgid "Period"
msgstr "Periode"

msgid "Please choose a valid language code."
msgstr "Silakan pilih kode bahasa yang valid."

msgid "Please enter a message before sending."
msgstr "Silakan masukkan pesan sebelum mengirim."

msgid "Please upload a .json settings file."
msgstr "Silakan unggah file pengaturan .json."

msgid "Plugin home page"
msgstr "Beranda plugin"

msgid "Policy URL"
msgstr "URL kebijakan"

msgid "Policy version"
msgstr "Versi kebijakan"

msgid "Position"
msgstr "Posisi"

msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Preferensi"

msgid "Privacy Policy & Terms"
msgstr "Kebijakan Privasi & Ketentuan"

msgid "Privacy/Cookie policy URL"
msgstr "URL kebijakan privasi/kuki"

msgid ""
"Private, cookieless statistics stored only in your own database. They are "
"fully aggregated — no IP address, no visitor identifier and no personal data"
" is ever recorded. Because of that, these statistics do not by themselves "
"require consent."
msgstr ""
"Statistik privat tanpa cookie yang disimpan hanya di basis data Anda "
"sendiri. Semuanya teragregasi sepenuhnya — tidak ada alamat IP, pengenal "
"pengunjung, maupun data pribadi yang pernah dicatat. Karena itu, statistik "
"ini sendiri tidak memerlukan persetujuan."

msgid "Read more"
msgstr "Baca selengkapnya"

msgid "Recent consent records"
msgstr "Catatan persetujuan terbaru"

msgid ""
"Records older than this are deleted automatically. Set to 0 to keep records "
"indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"Catatan yang lebih lama dari ini dihapus secara otomatis. Atur ke 0 untuk "
"menyimpan catatan tanpa batas waktu."

msgid "Region"
msgstr "Wilayah"

msgid ""
"Region is detected from CDN/edge headers (e.g. Cloudflare). When unknown, "
"the safest opt-in model is used. No external geolocation API is called."
msgstr ""
"Wilayah dideteksi dari header CDN/edge (mis. Cloudflare). Jika tidak "
"diketahui, model opt-in yang paling aman digunakan. Tidak ada API geolokasi "
"eksternal yang dipanggil."

msgid ""
"Register as the consent provider for the WP Consent API plugin and notify "
"other plugins of the visitor’s choice (functional, preferences, statistics, "
"marketing)."
msgstr ""
"Daftarkan plugin ini sebagai penyedia persetujuan untuk plugin WP Consent "
"API dan beri tahu plugin lain tentang pilihan pengunjung (fungsional, "
"preferensi, statistik, pemasaran)."

msgid "Reject all"
msgstr "Tolak semua"

msgid "Reject button"
msgstr "Tombol tolak"

msgid "Report a bug"
msgstr "Laporkan bug"

msgid "Request a language"
msgstr "Ajukan permintaan bahasa"

msgid "Request this language"
msgstr "Ajukan permintaan untuk bahasa ini"

msgid ""
"Required for the website to function and cannot be switched off. They are "
"usually set in response to actions you make, such as setting privacy "
"preferences or logging in."
msgstr ""
"Diperlukan agar situs web dapat berfungsi dan tidak dapat dinonaktifkan. "
"Biasanya disetel sebagai respons atas tindakan yang Anda lakukan, seperti "
"mengatur preferensi privasi atau masuk."

msgid ""
"Resting transparency (0.2–1.0). The button becomes fully opaque on hover or "
"focus. Default is 0.55."
msgstr ""
"Transparansi saat diam (0.2–1.0). Tombol menjadi sepenuhnya buram saat "
"diarahkan kursor atau difokuskan. Defaultnya 0.55."

msgid "Retention (days)"
msgstr "Retensi (hari)"

msgid "Round"
msgstr "Bundar"

msgid "Rounded"
msgstr "Bersudut membulat"

msgid ""
"Rounding of the banner, box and modal corners. Set 0 to use the default."
msgstr ""
"Pembulatan sudut banner, kotak, dan modal. Atur ke 0 untuk menggunakan nilai"
" default."

msgid "Save language settings"
msgstr "Simpan pengaturan bahasa"

msgid "Save preferences"
msgstr "Simpan preferensi"

msgid "Save-preferences button"
msgstr "Tombol simpan preferensi"

msgid "Send feedback"
msgstr "Kirim masukan"

#. translators: %s: link to the portal privacy/terms page.
msgid ""
"Sends only the plugin name, version and language code to the Lynbro portal. "
"See our %s."
msgstr ""
"Hanya mengirim nama plugin, versi, dan kode bahasa ke portal Lynbro. Lihat "
"%s kami."

msgid "Set"
msgstr "Tetapkan"

msgid ""
"Sets all consent signals to \"denied\" by default before consent, then "
"updates them based on the visitor’s choice (ad_storage, analytics_storage, "
"ad_user_data, ad_personalization, functionality_storage, "
"personalization_storage, security_storage)."
msgstr ""
"Menetapkan semua sinyal persetujuan ke \"denied\" secara default sebelum "
"persetujuan diberikan, lalu memperbaruinya berdasarkan pilihan pengunjung "
"(ad_storage, analytics_storage, ad_user_data, ad_personalization, "
"functionality_storage, personalization_storage, security_storage)."

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan"

msgid "Settings imported successfully."
msgstr "Pengaturan berhasil diimpor."

msgid "Shape"
msgstr "Bentuk"

msgid ""
"Share anonymous statistics to help improve the plugin — and see how your "
"accept rate compares to the average. Off by default. Sends only aggregated "
"numbers and your site domain (never visitor IPs) to the Lynbro portal, once "
"a week."
msgstr ""
"Bagikan statistik anonim untuk membantu meningkatkan plugin — dan lihat "
"perbandingan tingkat penerimaan Anda dengan rata-rata. Nonaktif secara "
"default. Hanya mengirim angka teragregasi dan domain situs Anda (tidak "
"pernah IP pengunjung) ke portal Lynbro, seminggu sekali."

msgid ""
"Show a \"Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\" link in opt-out "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan tautan \"Jangan Jual atau Bagikan Informasi Pribadi Saya\" dalam "
"mode opt-out."

msgid "Show floating settings button on the site"
msgstr "Tampilkan tombol pengaturan mengambang di situs"

msgid "Show language switcher"
msgstr "Tampilkan pengalih bahasa"

msgid ""
"Show the cookie icon (recommended). When off, the accessible label is shown "
"as a small text button instead."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan ikon cookie (disarankan). Jika dinonaktifkan, label aksesibel "
"ditampilkan sebagai tombol teks kecil."

msgid "Size (px)"
msgstr "Ukuran (px)"

msgid ""
"Sorry, that language could not be fetched right now. Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"Maaf, bahasa tersebut tidak dapat diambil saat ini. Silakan coba lagi nanti."

msgid "Sorry, the message could not be sent. Please try again later."
msgstr "Maaf, pesan tidak dapat dikirim. Silakan coba lagi nanti."

msgid "Square"
msgstr "Persegi"

msgid "Stacking (z-index base)"
msgstr "Penumpukan (basis z-index)"

msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Statistik"

msgid ""
"Statistics are currently turned off. Enable “Collect anonymous statistics” "
"in the General tab to start collecting aggregated numbers."
msgstr ""
"Statistik saat ini dinonaktifkan. Aktifkan “Kumpulkan statistik anonim” di "
"tab Umum untuk mulai mengumpulkan angka agregat."

msgid "Statistics are disabled."
msgstr "Statistik dinonaktifkan."

msgid ""
"Store a privacy-respecting proof of consent in your own database. No raw IP "
"address is stored — only a salted, anonymised hash for de-duplication."
msgstr ""
"Simpan bukti persetujuan yang menjaga privasi di basis data Anda sendiri. "
"Alamat IP mentah tidak disimpan — hanya hash anonim yang diberi salt untuk "
"deduplikasi."

msgid "Tablet"
msgstr "Tablet"

msgid "Tell us what you think, what is missing, or what went wrong…"
msgstr ""
"Beri tahu kami pendapat Anda, apa yang kurang, atau apa yang tidak berjalan "
"semestinya…"

msgid "Text color"
msgstr "Warna teks"

msgid "Thank you! Your message was sent."
msgstr "Terima kasih! Pesan Anda telah dikirim."

#. translators: %s: the average accept rate across opted-in sites.
msgid ""
"The average accept rate across opted-in sites is %s%%. Yours will show here "
"once visitors start choosing."
msgstr ""
"Rata-rata tingkat penerimaan di seluruh situs yang ikut serta adalah %s%%. "
"Angka Anda akan ditampilkan di sini setelah pengunjung mulai memilih."

msgid ""
"The banner language follows a cache-safe cascade: the current page language "
"(Polylang/WPML/TranslatePress), then your site language, then English. "
"Browser auto-detection and the optional in-banner switcher happen entirely "
"in the visitor’s browser, so your page cache is never affected."
msgstr ""
"Bahasa banner mengikuti urutan berjenjang yang aman untuk cache: bahasa "
"halaman saat ini (Polylang/WPML/TranslatePress), lalu bahasa situs Anda, "
"lalu bahasa Inggris. Deteksi otomatis browser dan pengalih opsional di dalam"
" banner sepenuhnya terjadi di browser pengunjung, sehingga cache halaman "
"Anda tidak pernah terpengaruh."

msgid "The file does not contain valid Lynbro Cookie Consent settings."
msgstr ""
"Berkas tersebut tidak berisi pengaturan Lynbro Cookie Consent yang valid."

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Tema"

msgid ""
"These are the languages prepared for browser auto-detection and the "
"switcher. Languages with a bundled translation appear here automatically. "
"Your site language is always included."
msgstr ""
"Berikut bahasa yang disiapkan untuk deteksi otomatis browser dan pengalih. "
"Bahasa dengan terjemahan bawaan akan muncul di sini secara otomatis. Bahasa "
"situs Anda selalu disertakan."

msgid ""
"This complements manual script marking. All detection is local; no external "
"request is made."
msgstr ""
"Ini melengkapi penandaan skrip manual. Semua deteksi bersifat lokal; tidak "
"ada permintaan eksternal yang dilakukan."

msgid ""
"This plugin helps with cookie compliance but does not constitute legal "
"advice."
msgstr ""
"Plugin ini membantu kepatuhan cookie tetapi bukan merupakan nasihat hukum."

msgid ""
"Tip: cookie/consent wording can have legal implications. Have the legal "
"parts of any translation reviewed by a person familiar with your "
"jurisdiction."
msgstr ""
"Kiat: redaksi cookie/persetujuan dapat memiliki implikasi hukum. Minta "
"bagian hukum dari setiap terjemahan ditinjau oleh orang yang memahami "
"yurisdiksi Anda."

msgid ""
"To view this content from %s, you need to accept the relevant cookies. The "
"provider may set cookies and collect personal data."
msgstr ""
"Untuk melihat konten ini dari %s, Anda perlu menerima cookie terkait. "
"Penyedia dapat menyetel cookie dan mengumpulkan data pribadi."

msgid "Today"
msgstr "Hari ini"

msgid "Too many requests."
msgstr "Terlalu banyak permintaan."

msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Peralatan"

msgid "Top bar"
msgstr "Bilah atas"

msgid "Top left"
msgstr "Kiri atas"

msgid "Top right"
msgstr "Kanan atas"

#. translators: %d: total number of consent records.
msgid "Total records: %d (showing the 50 most recent)."
msgstr "Total catatan: %d (menampilkan 50 terbaru)."

msgid ""
"Unchecking this hides the floating button completely — visitors will not see"
" a way to reopen their cookie settings (unless you add the "
"[lynbro_cookie_settings] shortcode somewhere)."
msgstr ""
"Jika opsi ini tidak dicentang, tombol mengambang akan disembunyikan "
"sepenuhnya — pengunjung tidak akan melihat cara untuk membuka kembali "
"pengaturan cookie mereka (kecuali Anda menambahkan kode pendek "
"[lynbro_cookie_settings] di suatu tempat)."

msgid "Updates"
msgstr "Pembaruan"

msgid ""
"Updates are delivered automatically through WordPress.org — there is no "
"custom updater and the free version never phones home."
msgstr ""
"Pembaruan dikirim secara otomatis melalui WordPress.org — tidak ada pembaru "
"khusus dan versi gratis tidak pernah mengirim data kembali ke server "
"pengembang."

msgid ""
"Used as the tooltip and screen-reader label. Leave empty for the translated "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Digunakan sebagai tooltip dan label pembaca layar. Biarkan kosong untuk "
"menggunakan teks bawaan yang diterjemahkan."

msgid "Used only when Position is \"Floating box\"."
msgstr "Hanya digunakan saat Posisi adalah \"Kotak mengambang\"."

msgid ""
"Used to track visitors across websites to display relevant advertising and "
"measure campaign effectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Digunakan untuk melacak pengunjung di berbagai situs web guna menampilkan "
"iklan yang relevan dan mengukur efektivitas kampanye."

msgid "Version & updates"
msgstr "Versi & pembaruan"

msgid "Vertical"
msgstr "Vertikal"

msgid "View changelog"
msgstr "Lihat log perubahan"

msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "Visibilitas"

msgid "Visit Lynbro"
msgstr "Kunjungi Lynbro"

msgid "WP Consent API"
msgstr "WP Consent API"

msgid ""
"We detected a Global Privacy Control signal and automatically opted you out "
"of non-essential cookies."
msgstr ""
"Kami mendeteksi sinyal Global Privacy Control dan secara otomatis menolak "
"cookie non-esensial untuk Anda."

msgid ""
"We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, serve personalized "
"content and analyze our traffic. You can accept all cookies, reject non-"
"essential ones, or manage your preferences."
msgstr ""
"Kami menggunakan cookie untuk meningkatkan pengalaman menjelajah Anda, "
"menyajikan konten yang dipersonalisasi, dan menganalisis lalu lintas situs "
"kami. Anda dapat menerima semua cookie, menolak cookie non-esensial, atau "
"mengelola preferensi Anda."

msgid "We value your privacy"
msgstr "Kami menghargai privasi Anda"

msgid "Width and height of the button (24–96). Default is 40."
msgstr "Lebar dan tinggi tombol (24–96). Nilai bawaan adalah 40."

msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

msgid "Write a review"
msgstr "Tulis ulasan"

msgid "Yesterday"
msgstr "Kemarin"

msgid "You can still block your own scripts manually:"
msgstr "Anda masih dapat memblokir skrip Anda sendiri secara manual:"

msgid "You do not have sufficient permissions to access this page."
msgstr "Anda tidak memiliki izin yang memadai untuk mengakses halaman ini."

#. translators: 1: this site's accept rate, 2: the average accept rate across
#. opted-in sites.
msgid ""
"Your accept rate over the last 7 days is %1$s%%. The average across opted-in"
" sites is %2$s%%."
msgstr ""
"Tingkat penerimaan Anda selama 7 hari terakhir adalah %1$s%%. Rata-rata di "
"seluruh situs yang ikut serta adalah %2$s%%."

msgid "Your consent banner is live"
msgstr "Banner persetujuan Anda sudah aktif"

msgid "Your email (optional)"
msgstr "Email Anda (opsional)"

#. translators: %s: link to the portal privacy/terms page.
msgid ""
"Your message, the plugin version and your site domain are sent to the Lynbro"
" portal. See our %s."
msgstr ""
"Pesan Anda, versi plugin, dan domain situs Anda dikirim ke portal Lynbro. "
"Lihat %s kami."

msgid "\"Read more\" link"
msgstr "Tautan \"Baca selengkapnya\""

msgid "iOS"
msgstr "iOS"

msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

msgid "site language"
msgstr "bahasa situs"

msgid ""
"Preparing your language… This can take about a minute the first time. It "
"will be added automatically — you can keep working."
msgstr ""
"Menyiapkan bahasa Anda… Untuk pertama kalinya, proses ini dapat memerlukan "
"waktu sekitar satu menit. Bahasa akan ditambahkan secara otomatis — Anda "
"dapat tetap bekerja."

#. %s: comma-separated list of language names.
msgid "Language ready and activated: %s"
msgstr "Bahasa siap dan diaktifkan: %s"

#. %s: comma-separated list of language names.
msgid "Could not prepare: %s. Please try again later."
msgstr "Tidak dapat menyiapkan: %s. Silakan coba lagi nanti."

msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Aksesibilitas"

msgid ""
"Apply this design preset? It will overwrite your current Design settings "
"(you can still review before saving)."
msgstr ""
"Terapkan preset desain ini? Ini akan menimpa pengaturan Desain Anda saat ini"
" (Anda masih dapat meninjau sebelum menyimpan)."

msgid "Calm, low-contrast palette in a rounded corner box."
msgstr ""
"Palet warna yang tenang dan berkontras rendah dalam kotak bersudut membulat."

msgid "Centered dialog with a dimmed overlay, dark theme."
msgstr "Dialog di tengah dengan overlay redup, tema gelap."

msgid "Colours meet WCAG AA accessibility"
msgstr "Warna memenuhi standar aksesibilitas WCAG AA"

msgid "Design presets"
msgstr "Preset desain"

msgid "Details"
msgstr "Detail"

msgid "Full-width bar at the bottom, light and neutral."
msgstr "Bar selebar penuh di bagian bawah, terang dan netral."

msgid "Hide details"
msgstr "Sembunyikan detail"

msgid ""
"One-click starting points. Applying a preset fills the Design fields below "
"and updates the live preview — review it, then Save Changes to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Titik awal dengan sekali klik. Menerapkan preset akan mengisi bidang Desain "
"di bawah dan memperbarui pratinjau langsung — tinjau, lalu Simpan Perubahan "
"agar tersimpan."

msgid "Preset applied. Review the preview, then Save Changes to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Preset diterapkan. Tinjau pratinjau, lalu Simpan Perubahan agar tersimpan."

msgid "Preview device width"
msgstr "Lebar perangkat untuk pratinjau"

msgid "Slim, square bar pinned to the top of the page."
msgstr "Bar tipis bersudut kotak yang disematkan di bagian atas halaman."

msgid "Soft floating card in the bottom-right corner."
msgstr "Kartu mengambang bernuansa lembut di sudut kanan bawah."

msgid "Some colours have low contrast (%s) — see details."
msgstr "Beberapa warna memiliki kontras rendah (%s) — lihat detail."
